      "298.15-1210.4 K: $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -8.304 - 0.992 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.471 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 42.300 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -8.304 + 0.992 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T + 0.471 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 21.150 T^{-1} - 28.240 \\times 10^{-3} T$",
      "1210.4-2000 K: $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -16.604 - 2.011 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.005 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 67.200 T^{-1}$",
